# =====================================================================
# FRAML_PROJECT
# The data/ folder is ~22 GB and the SQLite DBs are ~2.4 GB.
# GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB, so ALL of it stays local.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Datasets (regenerate/download locally, see data/README.md) ----
data/*
!data/README.md
*.csv
*.parquet
*.tsv

# ---- Databases (built by customer_db.py / memory.py) ----
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ---- Model artifacts ----
# ml_models/artifacts/*.joblib are small (<10 MB) and ARE committed so the
# pipeline is reproducible. Uncomment the next line to exclude them instead.
# ml_models/artifacts/
#
# The *_baseline.joblib files are the pre-tuning models that tune_models.py and
# train_aml_model.py --tune keep for comparison. They are regenerated by re-running
# the search, so they stay local rather than doubling the artifact size in the repo.
*_baseline.joblib
*.pkl
*.h5
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.bin

# ---- FAISS / vector stores ----
*.faiss
*.index
faiss_index/
vectorstore/
chroma_db/

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ---- Virtual environments ----
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.conda/

# ---- Secrets ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ---- Jupyter ----
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# ---- Testing / linting caches ----
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# ---- Node (npx pulls @bytebase/dbhub for the MCP server) ----
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*

# ---- Logs ----
logs/
*.log

# ---- IDE / editors ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Jupyter / Anaconda tooling artefacts ----
# anaconda_projects/  : Anaconda file-browser UI state (db/project_filebrowser.db)
# .virtual_documents/ : jupyterlab-lsp mirrors notebook code here so language
#                       servers can offer completion; a cache, regenerates.
anaconda_projects/
.virtual_documents/

# ---- generated audit trail (append-only, grows every run) ----
memory/agent_history.txt
memory/*.db

# ---- dissertation write-up (kept local until the paper is marked) ----
paper/

# ---- scratch ----
.__wtest
